    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <description><![CDATA[## What is Grok Bot?

Grok Bot is the desktop agent for Grok, xAI's AI assistant. It is closed source and
needs a Grok account.

## Usage

The package installs Grok Bot for the account that runs choco. Start it from the
Start Menu and sign in. It updates itself.
]]></description>
